      "heading": "Typing fails on a cold site",
      "html": "<p>Work gloves often do not work on touchscreens. Take them off and you are slower and colder. Cold hands type badly. Bright light makes screens hard to read.</p><p>Cold and in a hurry, people type the least they can. A thin entry makes a thin record.</p>"
    },
