      "heading": "Technical words",
      "html": "<p>The test is how it copes with model numbers, readings and fault codes. Common trade words come out well. You may need a quick correction for unusual phrasing.</p><p>In Quickler the voice note is written out and saved as the answer. If it is wrong, send a follow-up. Most of the time nothing needs fixing.</p>"
